00:29:37.680 --> 00:29:51.940
But the reason why that was done is because if you were copying, and this doesn't happen anymore, but if you were copying from a cartridge to a ROM back in the early days, it would most likely just grab the information from the first set.

00:29:52.660 --> 00:29:54.020
